- Python 3.10+
- (Optional) Docker & Docker Compose

## Local Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r docs/requirements.txt
pip install -e '.[dev]'  # installs the pinned dev/test stack; try `uv pip sync requirements/lock.txt`
```

Run Docs

```bash
mkdocs serve
```
